# COMPONENT

## ComponentCmlSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.componentcml

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal component-generation sample.

# SERVICE

## Greeting

### DESCRIPTION

Greeting service generated from CML.

### OPERATION

#### greeting

Returns a greeting contract through the generated query surface.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### SUMMARY

Return a greeting contract.

##### DESCRIPTION

Returns the generated greeting operation metadata for the sample component.

##### INPUT

Greeting query payload.

###### VALUE

####### GreetingQuery

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------+------|--------------|
| name | name | 1            |

##### OUTPUT

Greeting result payload.

###### VALUE

####### GreetingResult

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type   | multiplicity |
|---------+--------+--------------|
| message | string | 1            |
